## 10. Questions and fixes

**I can't sign in**
Use an email listed on the sign-in page (they come from your data) with password `demo123`. After a
re-import, sign in again if you were signed out.

**The app says it couldn't import the CSV data**
Check that the `Data` folder exists in the project folder and contains `.csv` files, then click **Try again**.

**I added a CSV file but see nothing new**
Go to Settings → **Re-import CSV data**. Then check Settings → Data sources to see what the new file contributed.

**A chart or card shows 0 or is empty**
Most charts cover a time window (last 30 days or 12 months). The sample data's deals closed in
2018–2019, so use Reports → **All time**.

**My changes disappeared**
Changes are stored in your browser. They are lost after a re-import, in a private window, on another
browser, or if browser data is cleared. Clearing browser data makes the app import the CSV files
again on next load.

**I can't drag deals on my phone**
Tap the card and use the stage bar in the deal panel.

**Where did a record come from?**
Open it and look at the bottom of its Timeline: "imported from <file>". Settings → Data sources lists every file.

**Focus AI says "Offline mode"**
No Anthropic API key is set on the server. Add one to `.env.local` (see section 7) and restart the app
to get full answers.

**Why does a deal show a different currency field?**
Amounts are shown in the currency chosen in Settings. If the CSV had another currency, it's listed on
the deal as "Currency"; the number is not converted.

